<!doctype html><html lang="sl" data-theme="light"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Prva prijava · Upravljanje zbora</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/styles.css?v=6"></head><body class="login-page"><div class="login-art first-login-art"><div class="login-brand"><span class="brand-mark">𝄞</span>Upravljanje zbora</div><div class="quote"><p class="eyebrow light">Prvi korak</p><h1>Zaščitite svoj novi račun.</h1><p>Začetno geslo je namenjeno samo prvi prijavi. Izberite svoje geslo, preden nadaljujete v aplikacijo.</p></div><div class="security-note">✓ Novo geslo bo veljalo takoj.</div></div><main class="login-panel"><form method="post" action="/prva-prijava" class="login-card"><p class="eyebrow">Obvezna menjava gesla</p><h2>Dobrodošli v zboru</h2><p class="muted">Račun <strong>{{username}}</strong> je bil samodejno ustvarjen ob vpisu člana.</p>
% if error:
<p class="form-error">{{error}}</p>
% end
<input type="hidden" name="username" value="{{username}}"><label>Novo geslo<input name="password" type="password" required minlength="8" placeholder="Najmanj 8 znakov" autocomplete="new-password"></label><label>Ponovi novo geslo<input name="confirmation" type="password" required minlength="8" placeholder="Ponovi geslo" autocomplete="new-password"></label><div class="password-rules"><span>✓ Najmanj 8 znakov</span><span>✓ Geslo naj ne bo enako uporabniškemu imenu</span></div><button class="button primary wide" type="submit">Shrani geslo in nadaljuj <span>→</span></button><a class="login-back" href="/prijava">← Nazaj na prijavo</a></form></main><script src="/static/app.js?v=6"></script></body></html>
